<h1>Shipping Information</h1>
<p>USPS shipping is a flat $8.95 for orders with a subtotal below $50. Shipping is free when the
    subtotal is $50 or more. The optional Premium Cache Drop is included in the subtotal.</p>
<p>Checkout accepts shipping addresses in the United States. The shipping option is shown at checkout.</p>
<p>For questions about production, delivery, or an existing order, contact
    <a href="mailto:anaya3dprints@gmail.com">anaya3dprints@gmail.com</a>.</p>
